Package: ldfreq
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Lexical Diversity and Frequency Profiles
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Ryuya",
        family = "Komuro",
        email = "komuro.4121@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Computes versioned lexical-diversity metrics from ordered token
    vectors and from raw English text. Results record the selected formula,
    parameters, token and type counts, and preprocessing choices such as Unicode
    normalization, case handling, lemmatization, and content-word selection.
    Separate functions compare Maas and sequential-MTLD definitions. Lexical
    level profiles use a caller-supplied New JACET 8000 list and report exact
    and cumulative token- and type-weighted coverage without redistributing the
    list. A bundled, versioned TUBELEX aggregate provides frequency, video
    prevalence, and channel prevalence profiles with explicit match coverage.
